<translate>
==== InsertAllBulletsReload ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. If the parameter is true, then the player loads ammo directly into the weapon.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
InsertAllBulletsReload = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

